WEBVTT

01:24.960 --> 01:27.760
ADAPTED FROM THE LEGEND
OF KUNSHAN JADE BY TAN TIANYIN

01:55.680 --> 01:57.680
Bravo!

02:09.080 --> 02:10.120
Good!

02:10.199 --> 02:12.760
So, this is Lady Yan's original
Water Sleeve Dance.

02:13.320 --> 02:14.640
Quite innovative!

02:14.720 --> 02:15.840
Does she aim

02:15.920 --> 02:18.240
to become Yangzhou's
"Silk-Washing Beauty"?

02:26.520 --> 02:28.600
ENDLESS FOREST SNOW
WORLD'S TOP BEAUTY

02:28.680 --> 02:30.080
-Fine poem!
-Indeed!

02:30.160 --> 02:31.400
Bravo!

02:31.480 --> 02:34.760
Tonight, I, Yan Fenfen,
dedicate this poem and painting

02:34.840 --> 02:37.040
to the Qionghua Festival.

02:37.120 --> 02:38.560
No starting bid.

02:38.640 --> 02:40.080
All donations raised

02:40.160 --> 02:42.680
will go entirely
to support the city's needy.

02:42.760 --> 02:45.840
I'm wishing
only for the people's well-being!

02:45.920 --> 02:49.480
Well done!

02:51.880 --> 02:54.920
Isn't that Lady Yu's outfit
from her victory 20 years ago?

02:55.720 --> 02:58.760
Combining poetry and painting
in dance is Lady Yu's signature style.

02:58.840 --> 03:01.400
If that's the case,

03:01.480 --> 03:03.600
isn't this stealing?

03:03.680 --> 03:06.960
So, Lady Yan is no "Silk-Washing Beauty".

03:07.040 --> 03:09.040
She's more like a blind imitation.

03:09.920 --> 03:11.160
Ladies and gentlemen,

03:11.240 --> 03:14.720
here, Songstress Yan Fenfen creates
a poem and painting through her dance.

03:14.800 --> 03:17.960
Wealthy patrons, please place your bids.

03:21.240 --> 03:22.760
I'll start with ten cash.

03:22.840 --> 03:24.640
Ten cash?

03:29.080 --> 03:30.440
Ten cash…

03:30.960 --> 03:35.640
Lady Yan's dance skills and artwork

03:37.240 --> 03:40.040
are exactly as they say,
"a blind imitation".

03:40.120 --> 03:43.800
They're worth exactly ten cash.

03:46.240 --> 03:47.240
Nonsense!

03:48.080 --> 03:51.200
Songstress Yan Fenfen donates ten cash!

03:52.320 --> 03:54.040
Bai Niao indeed has some talent.

03:55.640 --> 03:56.480
Ten cash?

03:57.800 --> 03:59.960
A songstress worth only ten cash!

04:03.040 --> 04:04.440
Pardon me, Lady Yan.

04:04.520 --> 04:05.680
It's not that I refuse to sell,

04:05.760 --> 04:08.440
but Lady Bai has already
laid claim to this piece

04:08.520 --> 04:10.720
and declared it to be reserved.

04:10.800 --> 04:13.120
It's only reserved,

04:13.800 --> 04:15.040
not yet purchased.

04:15.120 --> 04:18.000
I have cash and can pay in full.

04:18.079 --> 04:19.200
Well…

04:20.120 --> 04:21.200
Hongzhu.

04:21.279 --> 04:22.880
Sir, please accept this.

04:24.200 --> 04:26.520
Lady Yan, you're mastery
in poetry, painting, and dance.

04:26.600 --> 04:28.400
Once you put on this red gown,

04:28.480 --> 04:31.160
you're sure to win the top prize
at the Qionghua Festival!

04:32.760 --> 04:33.880
Poetry,

04:34.640 --> 04:35.640
painting,

04:37.640 --> 04:38.800
and dance.

04:47.080 --> 04:49.520
Lady Bai, it's your turn.

04:55.920 --> 04:58.880
Next, let's welcome Songstress Lady Bai!

05:22.400 --> 05:23.680
Lady Bai truly stands out!

05:23.760 --> 05:25.000
-Wonderful!
-Amazing!

05:25.080 --> 05:26.520
-Lady Bai is breathtaking!
-Awesome!

05:36.080 --> 05:37.280
Beautiful!

05:37.360 --> 05:38.440
Bravo!

05:38.520 --> 05:39.520
Truly magnificent!

06:13.040 --> 06:14.560
Duanwu, Lady Huan!

06:15.480 --> 06:17.160
Lady Bai descends from above,
playing the pipa.

06:17.240 --> 06:18.360
I've never seen anything like it before!

06:18.440 --> 06:21.560
And she's playing so fast, so brilliantly.

06:22.280 --> 06:23.720
Lady Bai,

06:23.800 --> 06:26.760
if you wore these mother-of-pearl
inlaid press-on nails to play the pipa,

06:26.840 --> 06:29.880
you'd surely shine at the festival.

07:12.240 --> 07:13.640
What's wrong?

07:15.600 --> 07:16.480
She got injured, perhaps?

07:16.560 --> 07:18.280
If her nails hadn't broken,

07:18.360 --> 07:20.920
she might have finished the piece
and become the top beauty.

07:21.000 --> 07:22.160
Indeed.

07:23.480 --> 07:25.040
-Such a pity.
-Yeah.

07:25.120 --> 07:27.240
-How did this happen?
-Is this Duanwu's trick?

07:27.840 --> 07:29.560
She brought this upon herself.

07:35.000 --> 07:37.280
What's going on?

07:41.880 --> 07:43.240
It happened so suddenly.

07:43.320 --> 07:46.440
I'm afraid she may not finish
this pipa piece.

07:46.520 --> 07:48.240
Quite a disappointment for everyone.

07:48.320 --> 07:49.800
Such a shame.

07:50.480 --> 07:53.920
Just her costume alone
is worth a small fortune.

07:54.000 --> 07:57.520
So, let's start the bidding
at 500,000 cash.

07:57.600 --> 07:59.800
Gentlemen, please place your bids.

08:06.320 --> 08:07.440
Esteemed patrons,

08:07.520 --> 08:09.960
who's interested in buying this attire?

08:10.040 --> 08:12.600
This is a rare chance.
Place your bids now.

08:15.680 --> 08:19.000
Zheng Wu certainly enjoys
stirring up excitement.

08:19.080 --> 08:21.360
It's not just about jewels
in this charity auction.

08:21.440 --> 08:22.760
It's also a showcase of talent.

08:23.280 --> 08:25.280
After all, we're not here just to shop.

08:26.600 --> 08:29.240
Such a pity she couldn't finish
that pipa piece.

08:30.760 --> 08:33.520
-Kang Ju.
-Two million cash!

08:35.880 --> 08:36.799
Two million cash!

08:37.400 --> 08:38.960
Anyone with a higher bid?

08:40.840 --> 08:43.919
Songstress Bai Niao
donates two million cash!

08:44.000 --> 08:46.840
Bravo!

08:52.200 --> 08:54.560
Next up, we have Songstress Xue Liniang!

09:02.520 --> 09:04.840
Isn't that the long-lost Xiangji Dance?

09:05.360 --> 09:07.560
Pity it's performed without music.

09:07.640 --> 09:09.440
It's lacking a bit of flair.

09:09.520 --> 09:11.000
Indeed.

09:46.800 --> 09:47.920
Isn't that Lady Huan?

09:48.760 --> 09:49.960
Lady Huan!

09:50.040 --> 09:53.360
Songstress Xue Liniang's Xiangji Dance,
accompanied by Lady Huan's pipa,

09:53.440 --> 09:55.120
who could possibly compare?

09:55.200 --> 09:56.400
Absolutely!

09:56.480 --> 09:58.000
Simply marvelous!

09:58.080 --> 09:59.160
-Well done!
-Splendid!

09:59.240 --> 10:00.600
Excellent!

10:01.160 --> 10:02.320
Bravo!

10:10.120 --> 10:12.360
-Amazing!
-Outstanding!

10:12.440 --> 10:13.960
Truly exquisite!

10:23.680 --> 10:24.520
Lady Xue,

10:29.760 --> 10:31.920
did those dance shoes fit comfortably?

10:33.040 --> 10:33.880
Thank you.

10:34.720 --> 10:35.680
Much appreciated.

10:36.800 --> 10:40.160
Lady Xue, why not try on this pair?

10:45.160 --> 10:46.880
-These are…
-Jing shoes.

10:48.320 --> 10:50.320
Paired with your dancing skills,

10:51.040 --> 10:52.240
they're sure to dazzle.

10:54.520 --> 10:56.600
And how is this different from Bai Niao?

11:00.360 --> 11:05.560
Lady Bai's intent was to hinder others,
while we are merely protecting ourselves.

11:07.240 --> 11:09.600
What do you mean by that?
I've already lost?

11:10.440 --> 11:11.800
If you're willing

11:12.320 --> 11:15.360
to perform with Lady Huan,

11:15.440 --> 11:18.840
it'd be hard to tell
who's first in Yangzhou.

11:18.920 --> 11:23.280
Me, second on the Qionghua list,
support a fading songstress?

11:24.600 --> 11:26.360
One plays, the other dances.

11:26.880 --> 11:28.960
Who is supporting whom?

11:32.200 --> 11:35.240
These Jing shoes have silver bells.

11:35.320 --> 11:38.440
I would add some jewels

11:38.520 --> 11:40.320
to match your dance,

11:40.400 --> 11:42.840
creating an utterly dazzling effect.
It'll be truly unmatched.

11:43.840 --> 11:45.640
Lady Xue,
wouldn't you like to give it a try?

11:46.160 --> 11:48.440
You've invested in Lady Huan.

11:48.520 --> 11:50.240
Why are you so attentive toward me?

11:57.320 --> 12:00.240
My shop Clear Mind will open in Yangzhou.

12:00.960 --> 12:05.360
Naturally, I welcome all esteemed guests,
bringing prosperity to all.

12:06.240 --> 12:08.800
Just like you, already one of the best.

12:08.880 --> 12:10.520
Clear Mind is new here.

12:10.600 --> 12:15.640
Helping you benefit me
and provides you with more security.

12:20.840 --> 12:22.440
Su Muzhe!

12:22.960 --> 12:24.840
How dare you plot against me?

12:24.920 --> 12:26.240
Plot?

12:27.000 --> 12:29.040
When I showed you
these inlaid press-on nails earlier,

12:29.120 --> 12:33.040
it was only to display
the craftsmanship of their carvings.

12:33.680 --> 12:35.840
Had you accepted my offer,

12:35.920 --> 12:39.440
I would have gifted you
the finest mother-of-pearl inlaid pipa.

12:39.520 --> 12:40.800
But you used

12:41.840 --> 12:45.000
my unfinished inlaid press-on nails.

12:46.000 --> 12:48.200
They're made from bamboo.

12:48.720 --> 12:50.200
It's naturally thin by nature.

12:50.720 --> 12:53.320
Pairing it with such intense music,

12:54.120 --> 12:55.240
of course, it would break.

12:55.320 --> 12:56.920
Blame yourself

12:58.200 --> 12:59.800
if you must blame someone.

13:00.520 --> 13:01.440
You…

13:14.800 --> 13:15.760
My lady!

13:19.120 --> 13:21.440
You… You dare strike me?

13:21.520 --> 13:23.280
You…

13:26.120 --> 13:27.840
Why wouldn't I dare?

13:30.280 --> 13:32.840
You resorted to stealing.

13:32.920 --> 13:34.320
Utterly disgraceful.

13:38.200 --> 13:39.360
Lady Bai,

13:41.720 --> 13:42.840
act with restraint

13:45.560 --> 13:46.960
at the Qionghua Festival.

13:50.520 --> 13:53.440
Duanwu!
Lady Huan is up next. Hurry and come!

13:53.960 --> 13:55.040
Coming!

13:58.840 --> 14:01.360
My lady, let me see.

14:02.520 --> 14:04.920
What shall we do about this?

14:15.600 --> 14:18.520
Wonderful!

14:18.600 --> 14:21.440
-Well done!
-Bravo!

14:27.960 --> 14:29.600
Absolutely beautiful!

14:31.520 --> 14:32.760
Magnificent!

14:32.840 --> 14:35.120
Truly exquisite!

14:35.200 --> 14:37.160
Superb!

14:37.800 --> 14:38.680
Amazing!

14:38.760 --> 14:40.960
-Truly excellent!
-Awesome!

14:41.640 --> 14:43.640
-Well done!
-Absolutely marvelous!

14:47.400 --> 14:51.040
I, humble and modest in appearance,
can offer only my dance to bring you joy.

14:51.800 --> 14:54.720
I'm pleased to donate the Qibao necklace

14:54.800 --> 14:58.400
for the peace and prosperity of Yangzhou!

14:58.480 --> 15:00.480
Well said!

15:00.560 --> 15:02.200
In my view,

15:02.280 --> 15:06.200
this Qibao necklace
must come from your Jubao House.

15:06.280 --> 15:07.760
Indeed.

15:08.920 --> 15:13.200
Songstress Xue Liniang
donates the Qibao necklace.

15:13.280 --> 15:15.560
The starting bid is two million cash.

15:15.640 --> 15:17.280
The Qibao necklace is exquisite,

15:17.360 --> 15:19.000
but Xue Liniang herself
isn't particularly remarkable.

15:19.080 --> 15:21.080
Lady Huan's pipa performance
still outshines hers.

15:21.160 --> 15:23.640
-Exactly.
-Who could possibly say for sure?

15:23.720 --> 15:25.120
Each has their own merits.

15:25.200 --> 15:27.200
No need to judge her.

15:27.280 --> 15:30.160
I'll bid 2,200,000 cash!

15:31.920 --> 15:32.960
You're too kind.

15:33.680 --> 15:34.640
I'll bid three million!

15:34.720 --> 15:36.280
I'll bid 3,500,000 cash!

15:36.360 --> 15:38.160
Four million cash!

15:38.240 --> 15:39.840
Four million!

15:39.920 --> 15:41.080
It keeps rising!

15:41.160 --> 15:43.360
Any bids over four million cash?

15:46.000 --> 15:47.000
Alright.

15:47.080 --> 15:50.320
Songstress Xue Liniang
donates four million cash.

15:50.400 --> 15:51.520
She now holds the top bid.

15:51.600 --> 15:52.520
Well done!

15:52.600 --> 15:53.520
Quite impressive!

15:53.600 --> 15:55.360
-Bravo!
-Bravo!

15:59.280 --> 16:02.240
Now we have Songstress Lady Huan.

16:07.880 --> 16:11.480
The tune is "Seven Steps, Seven Kills",
composed by my own hand.

16:11.560 --> 16:15.280
The pipa is the inlaid pipa
from Su's Clear Mind.

16:15.360 --> 16:18.520
This pipa has a foundation
of purple sandalwood,

16:18.600 --> 16:21.120
inlaid with 36,000 mother-of-pearl pieces.

16:21.200 --> 16:24.200
Such exquisite craftsmanship
is the pinnacle of artistry.

16:24.280 --> 16:26.120
Tonight, I donate this pipa,

16:26.200 --> 16:30.960
wishing for the flourishing of art
and peace under heaven.

16:32.200 --> 16:35.640
What a treasure, truly worth passing down!

16:36.320 --> 16:39.080
Lady Huan donates the inlaid pipa.

16:39.160 --> 16:41.200
The starting bid is four million cash!

16:48.320 --> 16:50.080
Who could afford such a sum?

16:54.280 --> 16:55.360
Four million!

16:58.680 --> 17:00.200
I'll bid 4,200,000 cash!

17:00.280 --> 17:01.960
I'll bid five million!

17:02.040 --> 17:03.160
Five million!

17:04.359 --> 17:05.359
Five million…

17:06.200 --> 17:07.200
I'll bid six million!

17:07.280 --> 17:09.640
Six million!

17:11.480 --> 17:13.800
Any bids higher than six million?

17:18.520 --> 17:22.560
It appears
Lady Huan's inlaid pipa has no equal.

17:22.640 --> 17:24.760
She truly deserves
the title of top beauty!

17:24.839 --> 17:26.800
Well-deserved!

17:28.960 --> 17:30.560
Bravo!

17:30.640 --> 17:32.200
Bravo!

17:32.280 --> 17:34.680
My heartfelt thanks to you all.

17:34.760 --> 17:37.720
Today, I've claimed the top beauty title.

17:37.800 --> 17:41.000
It's unrelated
to the Huan family or anyone else.

17:41.080 --> 17:43.840
The Huan family deceived me,
stole my dowry,

17:44.800 --> 17:47.880
then a heartless man
took advantage of my innocence.

17:49.320 --> 17:51.440
But how fortunate I am

17:51.520 --> 17:54.160
to have a friend
who helped me wholeheartedly.

17:54.920 --> 17:57.920
She's Su Muzhe from Clear Mind.

17:58.840 --> 18:01.560
Su Muzhe from Clear Mind?

18:01.640 --> 18:02.840
I've never heard of it before.

18:02.920 --> 18:07.280
Today, I would like to inform you all.

18:08.000 --> 18:12.440
Lady Huan is retiring from the stage,
never to perform again.

18:13.200 --> 18:14.800
Such a pity!

18:14.880 --> 18:16.880
Indeed, such a great loss!

18:16.960 --> 18:19.160
Farewell!

18:19.240 --> 18:20.760
See you at Clear Mind!

18:22.040 --> 18:23.560
Clear Mind…

18:24.600 --> 18:26.040
I'll certainly visit one day.

18:27.680 --> 18:30.400
Duanwu, this is wonderful!
Lady Huan has won!

18:30.480 --> 18:32.360
She also spoke her heart out.

18:34.520 --> 18:36.000
Lady Huan has retired.

18:37.880 --> 18:40.200
She has brought fame
to our shop Clear Mind.

18:41.320 --> 18:42.280
We…

18:46.960 --> 18:48.160
can finally open our shop.

18:50.360 --> 18:53.160
Wonderful! We can finally open!

19:18.080 --> 19:23.120
ZONGZI

19:45.600 --> 19:48.120
What? Still want to kill me?

19:52.840 --> 19:54.120
You're not worth it.

19:57.280 --> 19:58.360
Ms. Su,

19:59.320 --> 20:00.400
congratulations.

20:02.160 --> 20:05.360
With all your scheming
backing up Lady Huan,

20:05.880 --> 20:07.960
were you only aiming to be a merchant?

20:08.680 --> 20:11.480
If that was your goal, you've achieved it.

20:16.000 --> 20:18.040
Today, I waited here for you

20:19.520 --> 20:20.680
just to tell you this.

20:22.160 --> 20:23.400
I've made up my mind

20:27.120 --> 20:28.240
to settle down in Yangzhou.

20:29.840 --> 20:33.520
But right now, you don't have
the ability to go against me.

20:33.600 --> 20:35.000
But today, I won.

20:37.720 --> 20:40.800
I trust you know what I'll be doing next.

20:41.320 --> 20:44.760
And you should also know
that I won't give up easily.

20:44.840 --> 20:47.120
If you keep getting in my way,

20:47.960 --> 20:49.440
don't blame me
for not giving you a chance.

20:50.760 --> 20:54.080
Although you won today,
you know that with my resources,

20:54.160 --> 20:56.480
I can afford to lose countless times

20:57.640 --> 20:59.280
and keep going.

21:00.120 --> 21:01.160
But you…

21:02.080 --> 21:03.440
Just one loss

21:03.520 --> 21:06.040
would be your end.

21:06.120 --> 21:08.000
I'm already beyond redemption.

21:22.120 --> 21:24.840
Then do as you please, Ms. Su.

21:57.320 --> 22:00.320
-Let's have some more drinks!
-Sure!

22:00.400 --> 22:01.280
Here!

22:01.360 --> 22:02.440
Cheers!

22:02.960 --> 22:04.320
Try this. Here!

22:05.280 --> 22:06.600
Cheers!

22:06.680 --> 22:08.000
To us…

22:08.760 --> 22:12.560
-and Clear Mind!
-These hands truly are worth a fortune.

22:13.080 --> 22:14.720
Thank you, Lady Xue.

22:15.600 --> 22:16.520
Yes, indeed.

22:16.600 --> 22:17.840
-Let's add a little more.
-Yunxiu here will be

22:17.920 --> 22:20.000
our future Master Artisan of Clear Mind.

22:20.080 --> 22:21.080
Master Artisan?

22:21.160 --> 22:22.960
What is a Master Artisan?

22:23.040 --> 22:25.680
A Master Artisan is one who oversees
all drawings and craftsmanship.

22:25.760 --> 22:28.920
Everyone will respectfully
call you Master Artisan.

22:30.560 --> 22:32.040
Master Artisan?

22:32.560 --> 22:34.600
Duanwu, can I really do it?

22:35.400 --> 22:40.000
Yunxiu, you are the most talented
Master Artisan I've ever known.

22:43.640 --> 22:45.200
Master Artisan!

22:45.280 --> 22:47.280
Come on, Master Artisan!

22:47.360 --> 22:50.240
A toast to our Master Artisan!

22:54.240 --> 22:55.080
Lady Huan.

22:56.600 --> 22:59.480
I never expected you to retire like this.

23:00.120 --> 23:02.520
Such courage is truly admirable.

23:04.040 --> 23:04.920
Here!

23:12.680 --> 23:14.040
Yingtao, eat up.

23:14.800 --> 23:15.920
Thank you, Yunxiu.

23:17.360 --> 23:21.880
People like us,
no matter how charming we seem,

23:22.560 --> 23:24.600
are ultimately just playthings
of the wealthy.

23:24.680 --> 23:27.160
When favored, we're praised to the skies.

23:27.240 --> 23:30.000
When not, we're trampled into the mud.

23:30.600 --> 23:32.000
All these years,

23:32.640 --> 23:35.480
we've kept smiling,
welcoming and bidding farewell,

23:36.480 --> 23:38.400
seeming prosperous on the surface,

23:39.240 --> 23:41.200
but in reality, we're all alone.

23:43.720 --> 23:44.720
Muzhe,

23:48.200 --> 23:49.680
say a few words?

24:06.120 --> 24:08.960
Would you all like
a fallback option for the future?

24:09.040 --> 24:14.160
I plan to open Clear Mind with Lady Huan,
as you all know by now.

24:15.280 --> 24:18.480
Part of the capital comes from Lady Huan

24:19.000 --> 24:21.520
and the rest from Mr. Zheng.

24:23.480 --> 24:26.840
I'm willing to give each of you
a share in Clear Mind.

24:27.360 --> 24:29.200
All you need to do is invest.

24:29.280 --> 24:31.400
Each year, you'll receive dividends.

24:31.920 --> 24:34.480
That will give you a sense of security.

24:35.320 --> 24:36.320
How about it?

24:39.320 --> 24:40.800
What do you think?

24:42.840 --> 24:43.920
Really?

24:46.520 --> 24:47.600
This…

24:48.320 --> 24:50.000
Of course it's true.

24:50.560 --> 24:51.520
But…

24:51.600 --> 24:54.440
such a good deal doesn't come so easily.

24:55.080 --> 24:58.360
In return, I'll need you all
to promote Clear Mind.

24:58.920 --> 25:00.160
Thank you!

25:00.240 --> 25:06.320
With Ms. Su's Clear Mind in place,
we will finally have something to rely on.

25:07.880 --> 25:09.920
-Wonderful!
-Just wonderful!

25:10.000 --> 25:11.120
-Amazing!
-Truly wonderful!

25:11.200 --> 25:13.120
How wonderful.

25:13.200 --> 25:14.240
-Come on!
-Come on!

25:15.080 --> 25:16.720
Let's toast to Clear Mind!

25:16.800 --> 25:18.400
Let's toast to our Clear Mind!

25:18.480 --> 25:21.120
-Clear Mind!
-Cheers!

25:21.200 --> 25:23.000
-Cheers!
-Here, cheers!

25:24.760 --> 25:26.160
Sit down and eat, Miss.

25:27.240 --> 25:28.120
Here.

25:28.200 --> 25:29.200
My lady,

25:30.360 --> 25:33.160
may I work at Clear Mind?

25:33.840 --> 25:36.120
Is it because I scolded you
and hurt your feelings?

25:36.200 --> 25:37.680
No, my lady.

25:37.760 --> 25:40.120
If not for you,
I would have starved long ago.

25:40.640 --> 25:43.440
But I'm not suited for this.

25:43.520 --> 25:46.320
I'm no good at pipa or dance.

25:46.840 --> 25:48.400
I'd only be a burden to you.

25:51.080 --> 25:52.000
Have you thought it through?

25:59.480 --> 26:00.600
Then go ahead.

26:04.480 --> 26:08.000
Ms. Su, is there a need for help
at Clear Mind?

26:08.960 --> 26:10.480
Of course, we need more hands.

26:11.000 --> 26:14.040
Then, our Yingtao…

26:14.120 --> 26:15.720
Could she go with you?

26:17.960 --> 26:21.160
I don't know if Clear Mind
will succeed or fail,

26:21.960 --> 26:23.480
yet you'd still follow me?

26:23.560 --> 26:26.320
Good or bad, I'm willing to try.

26:30.800 --> 26:32.240
Then come to Clear Mind.

26:32.320 --> 26:35.120
Thank you, Ms. Su!

26:35.720 --> 26:36.760
Thank you, Lady Huan!

26:40.720 --> 26:42.080
Come on. Let's drink!

26:42.160 --> 26:43.120
My lady…

26:43.200 --> 26:44.760
-Let's drink!
-Let's drink!

26:44.840 --> 26:46.360
-Come on!
-Come quickly!

26:47.840 --> 26:49.160
-Let's drink!
-Let's drink!

26:49.240 --> 26:52.320
Cheers!

26:55.920 --> 26:56.960
These…

26:58.720 --> 27:00.360
are all Black Dragon Bandit loot.

27:04.680 --> 27:08.680
Could it be they fled south
after Hexi's crackdown?

27:10.360 --> 27:13.560
These people act as desert bandits
and also as water pirates.

27:15.680 --> 27:17.560
No wonder they look suspicious.

27:19.320 --> 27:21.080
This ship is heading for Yangzhou,

27:22.000 --> 27:24.040
so there must be someone there
fencing this loot.

27:25.000 --> 27:26.720
So, we've boarded
a pirate's ship by chance.

27:28.240 --> 27:29.640
By chance,

27:29.720 --> 27:32.840
or is someone using my name
to slip through undetected?

27:32.920 --> 27:33.760
Who knows?

27:35.600 --> 27:36.560
Shall we seize them all in one go?

27:41.200 --> 27:45.000
For now, hold our positions
and see who they're meeting.

27:48.560 --> 27:50.960
To help Lady Huan
win the top beauty title…

27:54.200 --> 27:55.840
you really do have some skill.

27:56.600 --> 27:58.280
Sign this contract before you.

27:58.360 --> 28:02.280
Once Clear Mind opens,
I'll grant you a position as a steward.

28:08.840 --> 28:12.480
"Su Muzhe willingly
sells herself as a servant

28:12.560 --> 28:15.080
to Zheng Zhiheng in Yangzhou…"

28:28.280 --> 28:29.760
You're courting death!

28:29.840 --> 28:32.720
Garuda, get out.

28:39.280 --> 28:42.520
I said I would manage your assets.

28:42.600 --> 28:44.040
When did I ever agree to be a servant?

28:44.120 --> 28:47.000
Then tell me. What do you want?

28:53.600 --> 28:56.520
Lady Huan has signed
the partnership agreement with Clear Mind.

28:57.240 --> 28:59.640
Other songstresses are also willing
to invest in Clear Mind.

29:00.560 --> 29:03.240
Now it's not me asking you
to join Clear Mind.

29:04.040 --> 29:06.160
Clear Mind doesn't lack investors.

29:07.320 --> 29:08.960
It's you, Mr. Wu,

29:09.560 --> 29:12.400
who lacks someone
truly capable of managing

29:12.480 --> 29:14.520
and growing your assets.

29:15.280 --> 29:16.360
Isn't that right?

29:16.920 --> 29:18.600
A retired top beauty

29:19.240 --> 29:21.880
and a group of nameless songstresses…

29:23.440 --> 29:25.880
You're all taking yourselves
too seriously.

29:25.960 --> 29:28.680
If you were the only son
of the Zheng family,

29:29.520 --> 29:30.520
it might be impossible.

29:31.520 --> 29:32.960
But alas,

29:33.040 --> 29:34.800
you have an older brother.

29:35.320 --> 29:37.120
Su Muzhe…

29:40.120 --> 29:42.720
are you out of your mind today?

29:45.760 --> 29:47.720
Calm down, sir.

29:49.080 --> 29:50.320
Hear me out.

29:51.400 --> 29:53.400
Right now, the income from Jubao House

29:53.480 --> 29:55.920
only barely covers
the Zheng family's expenses.

29:56.440 --> 29:59.400
No matter how wealthy you are,
it's all from Master Zheng's hand.

29:59.480 --> 30:03.160
Once Clear Mind opens, if it succeeds,

30:04.200 --> 30:08.600
would you still depend
on Master Zheng's small handouts?

30:09.400 --> 30:13.320
Lady Yu's position in the Zheng family
will also be much more secure.

30:14.360 --> 30:16.120
Aside from Clear Mind,

30:16.640 --> 30:18.960
what better option do you have?

30:19.840 --> 30:20.680
None.

30:30.040 --> 30:33.520
Forty percent shares,
five million cash, annual dividends.

30:34.360 --> 30:36.160
It may be more, it may be less.

30:36.240 --> 30:39.720
Since you have the discerning eye
to recognize a top beauty,

30:39.800 --> 30:41.080
why don't we

30:41.800 --> 30:44.080
make a longer-term deal?

30:44.600 --> 30:45.440
What do you say?

30:49.640 --> 30:53.200
Tell me where you plan
to open the shop first.

30:56.200 --> 30:58.440
Clear Mind rose to fame
at the Qionghua Festival

30:58.520 --> 31:00.440
thanks to Lady Huan's performance.

31:01.640 --> 31:02.960
If it's to open,

31:05.400 --> 31:07.560
it should be
at the most prominent location.

31:08.680 --> 31:09.600
Very well.

31:11.040 --> 31:12.480
I'll give you a chance.

31:13.680 --> 31:14.560
Where will it be?

31:23.280 --> 31:25.120
A place you'd never expect.

31:30.080 --> 31:31.240
Good.

31:34.600 --> 31:39.000
TAVERN

31:42.680 --> 31:46.960
SHUNFU TAVERN

31:53.360 --> 31:55.240
From Hepu to Guangzhou,

31:55.920 --> 31:57.840
then from Guangzhou to the Great Desert,

31:59.200 --> 32:00.920
time has flown by,

32:02.440 --> 32:04.400
and it feels everything has changed.

32:09.520 --> 32:11.600
Now I go by the name Su Muzhe,

32:13.480 --> 32:15.560
after many twists and turns,
I've come to Yangzhou,

32:16.680 --> 32:19.320
and finally established
my own shop Clear Mind.

32:20.680 --> 32:22.680
In this chaotic world,

32:24.080 --> 32:26.320
I now have a small place to call home.

32:27.360 --> 32:30.480
Lady Wu, we parted hastily in Guangzhou,

32:30.560 --> 32:33.440
but not for a moment
did I forget our bond.

32:33.520 --> 32:35.160
I still remember our ambitious words
from those days,

32:36.080 --> 32:38.240
how we listened to the Hu flute
and watched wealth pour in,

32:38.320 --> 32:40.840
gazed across the river
at the dashing young men of Qujiang,

32:40.920 --> 32:44.600
awaiting the day when we sisters
would share wealth and fortune.

32:44.680 --> 32:46.560
To fulfill the promise we made back then.

32:46.640 --> 32:51.760
Clear Mind in Yangzhou, Su Muzhe.

32:53.200 --> 32:54.040
Lady Feng.

32:55.360 --> 32:57.600
Lady Feng.
How much is this piece of jewelry?

32:58.400 --> 33:00.840
This one's 2,600 cash.

33:00.920 --> 33:02.800
But for a loyal customer like you,
let's make it 2,000.

33:02.880 --> 33:04.600
-I'll take it.
-Alright.

33:05.120 --> 33:06.760
What's got you so cheerful?

33:06.840 --> 33:08.880
Did some young gentleman
write you a letter?

33:08.960 --> 33:10.520
What young gentleman?

33:10.600 --> 33:13.440
It's my dear younger sister.
She's opened a shop in Yangzhou.

33:13.520 --> 33:15.760
Look, all the jewelry on my counter,

33:15.840 --> 33:17.920
including this piece of yours,
they're all designed by her.

33:18.000 --> 33:20.680
Yangzhou? That's a wonderful place.

33:20.760 --> 33:21.840
Absolutely.

33:22.360 --> 33:25.480
One day, our branch of Zhuobao House
will open in Yangzhou as well.

33:25.560 --> 33:27.240
Then, the two of us

33:27.320 --> 33:29.000
will dominate
the jewelry trade in Yangzhou.

33:29.080 --> 33:30.120
And we can choose any gentleman we like.

33:30.200 --> 33:32.160
In advance, congratulations to Lady Feng!

33:32.680 --> 33:33.560
Take care!

33:41.160 --> 33:44.080
Congratulations, Su Muzhe.

33:45.440 --> 33:50.480
All hardships will pass,
may you move forward with all your heart,

33:51.080 --> 33:53.920
with no mountains or seas
to hold you back.

34:04.800 --> 34:06.240
-Duanwu!
-Shrimp!

34:06.920 --> 34:08.760
Why are you still sleeping in today?

34:08.840 --> 34:10.120
Duanwu, you're amazing!

34:12.440 --> 34:15.520
-Duanwu, you really wore red!
-When have I ever lied to you?

34:16.320 --> 34:19.320
-Does it look nice?
-Duanwu, you look stunning!

34:20.000 --> 34:21.120
Where's Xiangzai?

34:21.639 --> 34:22.600
Here, here, here!

34:23.199 --> 34:25.800
-Coming, coming!
-Why are you so late today?

34:25.880 --> 34:27.679
-Is it heavy?
-No worries, no worries.

34:28.199 --> 34:30.480
-Where did Big Cao go?
-Big Cao's over there, slacking off.

34:30.560 --> 34:32.000
He's munching on chicken feet.

34:32.080 --> 34:34.480
Just because I stepped away, you blame me?

34:34.560 --> 34:35.600
It's opening day.

34:35.679 --> 34:37.639
At least hide
the chicken feet for now, will you?

34:37.719 --> 34:40.639
Sure, boss, it's almost opening time.

34:40.719 --> 34:43.480
-How about a little raise?
-All you think about is money.

34:43.560 --> 34:45.600
Earn it first before you spend it!

34:45.679 --> 34:48.040
I'm just saying it in advance.
I didn't say I need it now.

34:48.120 --> 34:49.239
Duanwu, don't give him money.

34:49.320 --> 34:51.400
Later, you need to buy me
some candied hawthorn.

34:51.480 --> 34:52.800
That's your plan?

34:52.880 --> 34:55.199
You silly! When I have money,
I'll buy you candied hawthorn myself!

34:56.920 --> 34:58.040
Make sense?

34:59.280 --> 35:00.520
Fine, I'll raise it.

35:00.600 --> 35:02.240
Alright, thanks, boss.

35:03.240 --> 35:04.480
Where's the manager?

35:06.120 --> 35:07.240
Over there.

35:08.040 --> 35:09.560
He went to buy firecrackers.

35:20.720 --> 35:22.760
Duanwu, what's wrong?

35:26.120 --> 35:27.600
Let me look at you one more time.

35:42.840 --> 35:43.960
Go on.

37:22.920 --> 37:27.920
CLEAR MIND

37:39.760 --> 37:40.680
Take a look.

37:41.200 --> 37:42.720
Friends and honored guests.

37:42.800 --> 37:46.320
Clear Mind opens today!
Come in and take a look!

37:46.400 --> 37:48.240
What does Clear Mind sell?

37:48.320 --> 37:50.440
Our specialty
at Clear Mind is inlaid jewelry.

37:50.520 --> 37:52.200
We also carry a full range
of gold, silver, and gems.

37:52.800 --> 37:54.240
What is inlaid jewelry?

37:54.320 --> 37:56.480
It's crafted from polished shells
and mother-of-pearl

37:56.560 --> 37:57.960
and looks stunning under light.

37:58.040 --> 37:59.880
Lady Huan's inlaid pipa
at the Qionghua Festival…

37:59.960 --> 38:00.920
That came from our Clear Mind.

38:01.000 --> 38:02.000
That's right.

38:02.080 --> 38:04.280
The inlaid pipa Lady Huan played
at Qionghua Festival

38:04.360 --> 38:06.640
was recognized as a treasure
by Inspector Xu.

38:06.720 --> 38:09.640
In all of Yangzhou,
only Clear Mind carries inlaid jewelry.

38:09.720 --> 38:10.840
Come on in and take a look!

38:10.920 --> 38:12.040
Inlaid jewelry…

38:12.120 --> 38:13.160
Is it expensive?

38:13.240 --> 38:14.760
Our prices are very reasonable.

38:14.840 --> 38:16.400
-The first ten pieces are one cash each.
-Let's go!

38:16.480 --> 38:18.640
-Limit one piece per person.
-Oh my.

38:18.720 --> 38:20.320
After the first ten, it's 100 cash each.

38:20.400 --> 38:22.240
Grab yours while you can!
Hurry and take a look inside.

38:22.320 --> 38:23.440
-Come on in!
-Alright.

38:24.240 --> 38:25.600
A full selection of jewelry awaits!

38:25.680 --> 38:27.440
My lady, come inside and have a look!

38:27.520 --> 38:29.120
Come on. Step inside and take a look!

38:29.920 --> 38:32.120
Young lady, welcome inside!

38:32.960 --> 38:34.560
Young lady, come shop with us!

38:35.840 --> 38:37.720
Sir, come in and have a look.

38:38.400 --> 38:40.640
First ten pieces are only one cash each!

38:40.720 --> 38:42.480
Welcome, everyone!

38:43.360 --> 38:45.200
Come on. Step in and have a look.

38:46.680 --> 38:48.280
Welcome, everyone!

38:50.880 --> 38:52.360
-Look at this. These earrings
-Are they wearable?

38:52.440 --> 38:53.760
-are also inlaid,
-Look at this one.

38:53.840 --> 38:55.400
-but they have a hint of green.
-Take a look.

38:55.480 --> 38:57.240
It complements the skin beautifully.

38:57.320 --> 38:58.320
This is lovely.

38:58.400 --> 38:59.480
We have a pair here.

38:59.560 --> 39:01.440
-Want to try them on?
-This style is quite nice.

39:01.960 --> 39:03.080
-Do you have any others?
-How about this one?

39:03.160 --> 39:06.760
-Yingtao, take care of her.
-Alright.

39:06.840 --> 39:07.680
Congratulations, congratulations!

39:07.760 --> 39:09.640
I thought you weren't coming.

39:09.720 --> 39:11.880
-It's been a while!
-Wishing you a prosperous opening!

39:11.960 --> 39:17.000
Our Clear Mind wouldn't be here today
without the help of you all.

39:17.640 --> 39:19.280
We'll take a look around first.

39:19.840 --> 39:21.800
Take your time. Let me know
if anything catches your eye.

39:21.880 --> 39:22.920
Alright.

39:23.840 --> 39:26.560
What is it? Something caught your eye?

39:26.640 --> 39:29.640
More than just caught my eye…
I'm overwhelmed with choices.

39:32.160 --> 39:33.400
I've already told Yingtao,

39:33.480 --> 39:36.160
anything you fancy today
will be a gift for you.

39:36.240 --> 39:37.320
Really?

39:38.480 --> 39:39.800
When have I lied to you?

39:41.000 --> 39:42.200
Yingtao!

39:43.000 --> 39:45.200
My lady is coming!
I'll come back in a bit.

39:46.440 --> 39:48.320
Is Yingtao helpful here?

39:48.920 --> 39:50.120
Extremely helpful.

39:51.160 --> 39:52.960
She's clever and hardworking.

39:53.040 --> 39:56.320
I know you gave her up reluctantly,
letting such a good girl come to me.

39:56.400 --> 39:57.400
Indeed.

39:57.480 --> 40:00.400
Yingtao has been with me for years.
It was hard to part with her.

40:00.480 --> 40:03.720
But she's happy here with you,
so I suppose I made the right choice.

40:05.720 --> 40:08.720
It's your big opening day.
Where's Lady Huan?

40:09.280 --> 40:10.800
Can't you guess?

40:11.320 --> 40:14.920
Lady Huan's always been quiet and refined,
not one for large crowds.

40:15.440 --> 40:18.200
With so many people here today,
she'd feel out of place.

40:19.520 --> 40:22.680
But on such an important day,

40:23.200 --> 40:25.200
she should come by to see me.

40:26.280 --> 40:29.680
Ms. Su, this is a gift
from Lady Huan for your opening.

40:29.760 --> 40:31.320
She won't be coming in.

40:33.880 --> 40:34.720
Thank you.

40:35.240 --> 40:36.640
Please tell Lady Huan

40:36.720 --> 40:38.400
that it's windy today.
She should head back early.

40:39.960 --> 40:41.000
Thank you, Ms. Su.

40:45.000 --> 40:46.720
-I'll go and put it away first.
-Alright.

40:50.000 --> 40:51.840
-This bracelet…
-If you like it, think it over.

40:53.200 --> 40:56.360
But if you're buying it,
you'll have to get the whole set.

40:57.400 --> 40:58.760
It looks best as a set.

40:58.840 --> 40:59.720
See here,

41:00.240 --> 41:03.240
a single bracelet doesn't stand out,

41:03.320 --> 41:05.280
but a full set is truly stunning.

41:05.360 --> 41:07.960
-Agreed.
-Su Muzhe has quite the eye for things.

41:09.240 --> 41:11.120
-I'll take it.
-Wait!

41:11.960 --> 41:13.440
I want the whole set.

41:13.520 --> 41:14.640
That won't do!

41:14.720 --> 41:17.880
When you spot a piece of jewelry you like,
you've got to act fast.

41:17.960 --> 41:20.880
If someone else takes it first, you'll
regret it in the middle of the night.

41:20.960 --> 41:23.000
-Exactly.
-Lady Xue is absolutely right.

41:23.080 --> 41:25.920
-Hand it over! Hand it over!
-I haven't worn it long enough.

41:26.000 --> 41:27.120
Yingtao!

41:27.200 --> 41:30.040
There are so many pieces in the store.
Let others try them on.

41:30.120 --> 41:32.280
-Let this set go, won't you?
-Yes, yes.

41:32.360 --> 41:33.440
Give it to me. Come on, come on.

41:33.520 --> 41:34.800
-Time to pay.
-Let's go!

41:36.840 --> 41:38.880
Why won't Yan Lang see me?

41:40.240 --> 41:41.400
My hand is like this,

41:42.080 --> 41:44.440
and he won't even hear me out.

41:44.520 --> 41:46.840
Lady Bai, you're a smart one.

41:47.840 --> 41:51.480
Tell me. Does someone with no use

41:52.320 --> 41:53.640
deserve to see our Lord?

41:55.000 --> 41:56.320
Go home and tend to your injury.

42:03.080 --> 42:05.960
Don't set foot
in our Zhenlang Pavilion again.

42:06.560 --> 42:09.720
Otherwise, that hand will be broken too.

42:18.320 --> 42:21.480
Lady Bai, let's head back.

42:30.160 --> 42:31.520
The view from here is breathtaking.

42:32.240 --> 42:34.440
-Isn't it?
-Indeed.

42:34.960 --> 42:35.880
Miss Xue.
